Text: [11] proposed two new features with existing hand crafted features and developed the system using HMM based approach. Some researchers have used appearance-based features and divided the approach into sub units of RGB and tracking data, with a HMM model for recognition [12]. Compared to RGB methods, skeletal data has received little attention in ASL recognition.

